# handle-drag-no-pan (h7-plane): a press on the diamond moved 150 px right
# in 5 px steps (30 steps, every one hits), held: h = 4.0, the centre
# unchanged — no center key in the URL. Ends held (up with no read).
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
query func=x2&a=2&h=1&k=-3
wait 500
move 978 640
wait 200
down
wait 150
move 1128 640 over 480
wait 300
shot handle-drag-no-pan
up
